<body>
    <h1>Japan Travel Handbook</h1>
    
    <div class="section">
        <h2>Itinerary Overview</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Day 1 (Apr 15): Arrive in Tokyo, evening in Shinjuku</li>
            <li>Day 2 (Apr 16): Tokyo - Senso-ji Temple, Asakusa, tea ceremony</li>
            <li>Day 3 (Apr 17): Day trip to Kamakura - Great Buddha, Zen meditation</li>
            <li>Day 4 (Apr 18): Travel to Kyoto, visit Kinkaku-ji, evening in Gion</li>
            <li>Day 5 (Apr 19): Kyoto - Arashiyama, Tenryu-ji, proposal at Kiyomizu-dera</li>
            <li>Day 6 (Apr 20): Day trip to Nara - Todaiji Temple, deer park</li>
            <li>Day 7 (Apr 21): Kyoto - Fushimi Inari, kendo, onsen</li>
            <li>Day 8 (Apr 22): Return to Tokyo - Meiji Shrine, Harajuku</li>
            <li>Day 9 (Apr 23): Depart from Tokyo</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

